step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<str>I have spoken to Abigale, she and her friends were attacked on an island just off the coast of Lumbridge swamp.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>I agreed to sail to the island in search of the attacker, and her friends that were left behind. Abigale says the boat she used to escape can be found on the South-Eastern shore of Lumbridge swamp.</col>
